Our life is a sequence of events. To make your emotions brighter you need just to select a right soundtrack. Download the Bananastreet App and discover new music from the best DJs every day!

Listen to the playlists for different activities and mood, charts with popular tracks as well as thousands of releases from top Russian and world DJs.

Free features of the App:
• Streaming without any limits of duration and number of tracks;
• Background mode listening;
• Normal quality audio (up to 96kbps);
• Save your favourite releases, tracks and playlists to your music library;
• Create your own playlists;
• Subscribe to your favourite DJs to get informed of new releases;
• Search for music among the many presented styles.

Premium Subscription features for Listeners:
• High quality audio (up to 320kbps);
• Unlimited skips;
• Rewind;
• Download and listen offline;
• No ad.

Pro Subscription features for DJs:
• Upload your releases and view detailed statistics;
• High quality audio (up to 320kbps);
• Unlimited skips;
• Rewind;
• Download and listen offline;
• No ad.

The functions for uploading releases and viewing statistics are available in the web version for DJs who have activated Pro Subscription.

Upon confirmation of your purchase, payment will be debited from your Apple ID account. Your subscription will be automatically extended for an equivalent time period unless automatic extension is disabled at least 24 hours before the expiration of the current subscription. You can manage your subscription and disable automatic extension in your account settings.

